{"nodes": [{"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_03_01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df_\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9_\u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4_\u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7_\u05ea\u05e8_2549nis", "label": "Tax Invoice-Receipt 60220 (type 320) \u2014 \u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df \u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9 \u2014 \u20aa2,549 (01/03/2026)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-03-01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df_\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9_\u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4_\u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7_\u05ea\u05e8_2549nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Arik Einstein project, final payment for work already done: 12 studio hours \u00d7 \u20aa180 = \u20aa2,160, rounding +\u20aa0.17, VAT \u20aa388.83, total \u20aa2,549. Paid 27/02/2026 as part of a single \u20aa3,823 transfer. The footnote reads '\u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05df \u05e2\u05e1\u05e7\u05d4 4022', a truncated or mistyped number. The matching deal is 40220 (same client, same \u20aa2,549)."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_whole_shekel_rounding", "label": "Whole-Shekel Rounding Line (\u05e2\u05d9\u05d2\u05d5\u05dc)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-03-01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df_\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9_\u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4_\u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7_\u05ea\u05e8_2549nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Hebrew Theatre receipts add a rounding line (+\u20aa0.17 / \u2212\u20aa0.34) so the gross total lands on a whole shekel (\u20aa2,549 / \u20aa1,274) and matches the original deal amounts."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_hebrew_theatre_split_transfer_3823", "label": "Hebrew Theatre bank transfer \u20aa3,823 (27/02/2026) split across 60220 + 60221", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-03-01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df_\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9_\u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4_\u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7_\u05ea\u05e8_2549nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One \u20aa3,823 transfer equals \u20aa2,549 + \u20aa1,274 and settles two deals (40220 and 40219). Both receipts note '\u05d7\u05dc\u05e7 \u05de\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d4 \u05d1\u05e0\u05e7\u05d0\u05d9\u05ea \u05d1\u05e1\u05d4\u05f4\u05db 3,823', so reconciliation has to match one bank credit to two documents."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_studio_hour_rate_180", "label": "Studio Hour (\u05e9\u05e2\u05ea \u05d0\u05d5\u05dc\u05e4\u05df) @ \u20aa180", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-03-01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df_\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9_\u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4_\u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7_\u05ea\u05e8_2549nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An hourly studio/production service priced at \u20aa180 net, used for the Hebrew Theatre projects."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_client_hebrew_theatre", "label": "\u05d4\u05ea\u05d9\u05d0\u05d8\u05e8\u05d5\u05df \u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9 \u2014 \u05e2\u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d4 \u05dc\u05d8\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05d7 \u05ea\u05e8\u05d1\u05d5\u05ea \u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05ea (The Hebrew Theatre, non-profit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-03-01_type320_num60220_\u05d4\u05